          Subtitle = "You kneel beneath the sacred hall's stained glass.\nThe white-robed goddess gazes down from her towering portrait — serene, silent, and sorrowful.\nThe lunar deity steps forth from the mosaic's kaleidoscope hues, her beaded crown brushing your cheek as she kisses your forehead……"
        },
        [6100308] = {
          ContentKR = "퉁!\n누군가가 당신의 이마를 튕긴다. 당신은 통증에 깜짝 놀라 일어난다.",
