          ContentKR = "게다가 당신까지 얼어 죽기라도 하면, 제 무서운 여동생이 절 가만두지 않을 거예요.",
          DialogueId = 10035237,
          FinalCamera = "18.257643,30.248974,152.72583,0.0002,3.779478,-84.856224,30.000002,95.997826,false,Manual,10.0",
          GUID = "191F4612",
          NextDialogue = 10035238,
          SpeakNpcId = 200021,
          Subtitle = "And besides, if you freeze to death, that terrifying little sister of mine will make sure I pay for it.",
          TalkActionId = {
