          },
          NextDialogue = 12001531,
          SpeakNpcId = 200002,
          Subtitle = "So this is your \"important client,\" huh? Hm-hmm, well, you two chat away. The ever-mature and oh-so-reliable Snow is off to have some fun on her own!",
